f483da4e3.webm?t=1760946180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024160/extras/6cde1dd5bed023b5609a406f483da4e3.mp4?t=1760946180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Metro Rivals is a bold and innovative blend of strategy racing, light simulation, and story-driven action game that requires nuance and skill as well as speed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024160/extras/3adf703282952ea41da7ef5bedd9581c.poster.avif?t=1760946180\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024160/extras/3adf703282952ea41da7ef5bedd9581c.webm?t=1760946180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024160/extras/3adf703282952ea41da7ef5bedd9581c.mp4?t=1760946180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push yourself to the limits in the story-driven single player mode </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge your friends in a fierce head-to-head on-track battle with up to 4 friends in a PvP mode </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play objective-free, chill out and explore this unique take on the New York City  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Apply your own style with customisable trains </p></li></ul>","developers":["Dovetail Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024160/be2fdd3ffecb6e84e561d47dcc53effbad54d8c4/header.jpg?t=1760946180","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a92025 Dovetail Games, a trading name of RailSimulator.com Limited (\u201cDTG\u201d). \u201cMetro Rivals\u201d and \u201cSimuGraph\u201d are trademarks or r